      "text": "7 November · Puno to Cusco by tourist coach",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6kxp21-vlap279rsy",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:fb5db666cae6efb7",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ff1dd61689d5b7c395d902577f9e8d81728175ccb5aa36130fc7141f17778eff",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to the bus station for a group journey to Cusco on a dedicated tourist coach, with stops along the way and lunch in Sicuani. Arrive at Cusco bus station in the evening and transfer to your hotel.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6kxp21-vlap279rsy",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:c37e5c0281948aee",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ff1dd61689d5b7c395d902577f9e8d81728175ccb5aa36130fc7141f17778eff",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to the bus station for a group journey to Cusco on a dedicated tourist coach, with stops along the way and lunch in Sicuani. Arrive at Cusco bus station in the evening and transfer to your hotel.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6kxp21-vlap279rsy",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:a5134a0761fa51f8",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7b317654423b86b0e464124c48e264564820716baa4bfe8b61ae68ad586355eb",
      "text": "We head to the bus station for a group transfer to Cusco on a dedicated tourist coach. Along the way, we stop in Andahuaylillas, home to the church known as the Sistine Chapel of South America, and at Raqchi, an Inca administrative complex. After lunch in Sicuani, we stop at La Raya Pass, 4,400 metres above sea level, where a roadside market looks out on the mountains. We then visit Pukara, a centre of the pre-Inca culture of the same name. We arrive at Cusco bus station in the evening and transfer to the hotel.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6kxp21-vlap279rsy",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
    {
