      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7d52bd00957d702720edd7d67e432a207cd300825d90ffe64ccd705f4d662b43",
      "text": "Mountain road in a valley near La Raya Pass between Cusco and Puno, Peru",
      "provenance": {
